bluejetty:00119685:ios.description:
There are in the market a lot of cars with automatic transmission. How to know exactly each one's transmission type and model? It's necessary a guide to give directions to the mechanic, facilitating one's work in the transmission maintenance.
Touver Automatic Transmission Guide is a catalog of automatic transmissions, organized by vehicle, offered by Touver Training Center. Its purpose is to organize the information and help the mechanic in his maintenance work in the transmission.
Features:
• Light, practical and easy to use;
• Provides the Type and Model of each vehicle, organized in the catalog;
• Provides the certified transmission fluid for most transmission models;
• Works offline, no need for internet connection.
Touver is a specialized company in maintenance training on automatic transmissions - light line. The Training Center in which the courses are held is located in Blumenau (SC, Brazil).
For more information about courses, classes, registrations and values, visit http://www.touvertreinamentos.com.br/.

